{'symbol': 'ADI', 'date': '2023-05-18 16:01:00', 'title': 'ANALOG DEVICES ANNOUNCES CFO TRANSITION', 'text': "WILMINGTON, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ANALOG DEVICES, INC. (NASDAQ: ADI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PRASHANTH MAHENDRA-RAJAH, ADI'S EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, HAS INFORMED THE COMPANY THAT, AFTER SIX YEARS LEADING THE FINANCE OPERATION, HE WILL STEP DOWN FROM HIS POSITION TO EXPLORE OTHER OPPORTUNITIES. PRASHANTH WILL REMAIN WITH ADI THROUGH THE END OF THE FISCAL YEAR TO ENSURE A SEAMLESS TRANSITION TO NEW FINANCIAL LEADERSHIP. “I HAVE GREATLY APPRECIATED PRASHANTH'S EXPERT."}